      "cost": "10 MP",
      "damage_bonus": "0",
      "description": "<p>You may spend 10 MP to track prey that is not currently in the scene and whose leads can be followed through conventional, hunter-related means.</p>\n<p>The target must perform an Opposed <strong>WLP (Willpower) + INS (Insight)</strong> Check against you, and you gain a bonus equal to <strong>[SL]</strong> on this Check.</p>\n<p>If the tracking is successful, you arrive at the prey’s location. If a conflict begins, your first Accuracy Check gains a bonus of <strong>[SL]</strong> against the prey. If successful, it deals an additional <strong>[HR (High Roll) + 15]</strong> damage.</p>\n<p>This ability ends if you are reduced to 0 HP, 【⚔️ Attack】 the prey, choose to track another target, or by Game Master ruling.</p>\n",
